# Image pins for the LLM gateway (G1.6). Repository state: `make llm-gateway-*` sources this file
# last, so a value in the environment cannot swap the image.
#
# LiteLLM proxy, MIT core only (no enterprise feature is configured), pinned by version AND digest
# so the tag cannot be moved under us. v1.108.5 was published 2026-11-10, older than the 14-day
# release soak this repository requires, and is the newest stable release that satisfies it.
#
# Updating it is a pin bump: a new version and digest, then re-run `make llm-gateway-test`
# (tests/test_llm_gateway_rotation.py runs this image against fake upstreams).
AEGIS_LLM_GATEWAY_IMAGE=ghcr.io/berriai/litellm:v1.108.5@sha256:008a5916c0a0ca6f4f6ad64969f6a4ef6f03ce885a639f3d97fd53665754ce48
